# Everything the image must not carry.
#
# `.env` first and deliberately: the requirement is that an artifact built from
# this repository contains no credential, and the builder stage does `COPY . .`.
# A developer's local .env is the one file that would turn that into a lie.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log*

# Not needed to build or run, and each one is weight in a layer.
tests
docs
_IDEA
_PM
.claude
coverage
*.md
!README.md

# openspec/ is excluded except for the design system, which `prebuild` reads to
# regenerate app/tokens.css. Excluding the whole directory made `next build` fail
# in the image while succeeding everywhere else — the tokens are an input to the
# build, not documentation.
openspec/*
!openspec/design
openspec/design/*
!openspec/design/system.json
